## Phase 4 — Gamification (optional, Carrot-themed)

Light engagement layer — do not block core productivity features.

### 4.1 Streaks & carrots
- Daily "plant" when user completes ≥1 note
- Streak counter on Calendar header
- Carrot growth stages (seed → sprout → carrot) based on weekly completions

### 4.2 Achievements (local first)
- Badges: "First note", "7-day streak", "Inbox zero", "10 checklists"
- Store in `users/{uid}/stats` subcollection
- Toast on unlock; gallery in Settings

### 4.3 Gentle nudges
- End-of-day summary notification (opt-in)
- No punitive mechanics — avoid guilt-based copy

