---

## Conventions for agents

- **Minimize scope:** One phase item per PR when possible
- **Match existing patterns:** `useTheme`, `ui` tokens, copyright header on new files
- **No breaking changes:** Old notes without `type` must keep working
- **Firebase:** User-scoped queries only (`where('userId', '==', userId)`)
- **Notifications:** Always cancel on delete; upsert on date/time change
- **Do not** add new dependencies without justification (prefer expo-* packages)
